    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/b5f6025825f5de376554a7d94924ced1.poster.avif?t=1754215892\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/b5f6025825f5de376554a7d94924ced1.webm?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/b5f6025825f5de376554a7d94924ced1.mp4?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Step into the role of a young witch, Rena, who finds herself in an extraordinary world. There are no gods or religions here, but plenty of powerful entities and mysterious cults. The skies are filled with airships, the roads are raced by steam-powered carriages, but you can easily encounter wizards, demons, fascinating races, and visitors from other worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors will come to you for advice or to buy potions to solve their problems. But will you choose to help them? After all, you can deceive or persuade your guests, steer them toward the light or the dark (depending on what benefits you the most), force them into servitude, or win them over with kindness. No one will judge you\u2014this is your story! And not every healing potion will serve a noble purpose, nor will a tangle of tentacles always turn your guest into a true monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce or leave them yearning, make influential friends and get rid of enemies, help heroes or villains! The game remembers all your actions, and sooner or later, they will impact the narrative branches. Power and glory, fear and bravery, honor and deceit\u2014these are mere words to someone who has donned a witch's hat and stood by the cauldron. Your craft unlocks countless possibilities; you just have to choose the path Rena will take.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/ccf8a2f7179b8769be90e09dcc9d95ca.avif?t=1754215892\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/244dd7fe163dc17080d801bd69b863e0.poster.avif?t=1754215892\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/244dd7fe163dc17080d801bd69b863e0.webm?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/244dd7fe163dc17080d801bd69b863e0.mp4?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/ad94815874a72cd195d69bfed89ab95a.avif?t=1754215892\" data-has-big width=800 height=152 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/ec334100398fc302e40c5b105dc35ad1.poster.avif?t=1754215892\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/ec334100398fc302e40c5b105dc35ad1.webm?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/ec334100398fc302e40c5b105dc35ad1.mp4?t=1754215892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957880/extras/d16e8d278e3887080ac5e9a996d12f8e.avif?t=1754215892\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 